## GoIndiaCab - Local Environment Configuration Template
##
## Instructions:
## 1. Do NOT commit your actual `local.properties` file (it is already in .gitignore).
## 2. Copy or add the variables below into your personal `local.properties` file at the repository root.
## 3. Replace the placeholder values with your development/testing keys.

# Location of your local Android SDK (automatically populated by Android Studio)
# sdk.dir=/Users/<username>/Library/Android/sdk

# Google Maps & Places API Key
# Used for live Google Places Autocomplete, Geocoding, and Map display.
# Keep this private. Always restrict this key in Google Cloud Console by:
# - Android application package (com.example.goindiacab) & SHA-1 fingerprint.
# - API restrictions: Places API, Geocoding API, Maps SDK for Android.
MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_HERE
